error[jexpr::parser::object::empty]: Empty object not allowed
  ╭▸ 
1 │ {}
  │ ━━ empty objects are not allowed as expressions
  │
  ├ help: specify a constructor key such as `{"#literal": 42}`, `{"#struct": {}}`, or `{"#dict": {}}`
  ╰ note: J-Expr objects must contain a constructor key:
          - `{"#literal": value}` for primitive literals
          - `{"#struct": {...}}` for structs with named fields
          - `{"#dict": {...}}` or `{"#dict": [[k, v], ...]}` for dictionaries
          - `{"#tuple": [...]}` for fixed-size tuples
          - `{"#list": [...]}` for lists
          each construct also accepts an optional `"#type"` annotation
